New update for Insanity Clicker, which we did chat is even better:

• Added the ability to write appeals to a particular user in the public channels;
• Removed the yellow square that appears when you press the Tab key;
• Chest now appear on top of the chat;
• Fixed display of characters other users;
• Fixed display ban timer from banned users;
• Added the ability to write private messages to several people at a time (by clicking on the “locks” next to the nickname or nicks in personal messages).

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/25281221/5a29031f397a3d1cba92d9c782ac38c16ed06cf6.png[/img]

